  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Lut, his family, the angels and the people of the city are never drawn; no plate starts on an imperative to Lut. A moon from «الليل» (it lives across the reciter's repeats of 65:7-8 and 65:14), an hourglass for the decree (66), gone before the city's people come (67). 65:8-11 «ولا يلتفت منكم أحد» is not glossed (Al-Muyassar: beware of turning; As-Sa'di: hurry). 66:1-4 is not glossed (both tafsirs paraphrase in Allah's first person)."
